# peeryard patch ergo/004: Do not start full block download inside a NiPoPoW headers gap
# upstream: ergoplatform/ergo#2596 (proposed); origin, witness and responses in patches.json
commit 8e408e4f7feb5a2736751cbc8d63d78d97cc5a03
Author: cafebedouin <cafebedouin@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 14:34:30 2026 -0500

    Spec: popow gap assertions print the heights they check
    
    Boolean assertions over a predicate are replaced by assertions on the
    values (the floor against the first connected height, the heights without
    a header, the scheduled sections below the floor), so a failure shows them.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

